    "detailed_description": "<strong>BLIGHTWRECK</strong> is a handcrafted 2D action-adventure Metroidvania set in a sunken ocean liner. Explore the bowels of the Starchaser, and the ocean floor surrounding it to find a way home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332060/extras/0dbadc97fc70b7b6ee39472de2455efa.avif?t=1752643848\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Five wildly different areas to explore, each filled with an assortment of upgrades to find and enemies to fight. Traverse the Starchaser\u2019s wreck in this tight 2D platformer.<br></li><li>Gorgeous hand drawn 32 bit pixel art, with colorful yet atmospheric environments to traverse. No two areas look alike, and enemies are filled with personality.<br></li><li>An energetic soundtrack that pulls from a charcuterie board of 90s electronic music. Head bang to the boss theme while fighting a giant squid, relax and chill out to the melodic tones of the Kelp Forest in the ambience of a glowing jellyfish.<br></li><li>Uncover the mystery of the Starchaser\u2019s sinking\u2026 Where are all the bodies?<br></li><li>Lots of crabs.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332060/extras/0ce753e2726bf93ccc725e9fe9247355.poster.avif?t=1752643848\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332060/extras/0ce753e2726bf93ccc725e9fe9247355.apng?t=1752643848\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>BLIGHTWRECK</strong> is a handcrafted 2D action-adventure Metroidvania set in a sunken ocean liner. Explore the bowels of the Starchaser, and the ocean floor surrounding it to find a way home.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332060/extras/0dbadc97fc70b7b6ee39472de2455efa.avif?t=1752643848\" /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Five wildly different areas to explore, each filled with an assortment of upgrades to find and enemies to fight. Traverse the Starchaser\u2019s wreck in this tight 2D platformer.<br></li><li>Gorgeous hand drawn 32 bit pixel art, with colorful yet atmospheric environments to traverse. No two areas look alike, and enemies are filled with personality.<br></li><li>An energetic soundtrack that pulls from a charcuterie board of 90s electronic music. Head bang to the boss theme while fighting a giant squid, relax and chill out to the melodic tones of the Kelp Forest in the ambience of a glowing jellyfish.<br></li><li>Uncover the mystery of the Starchaser\u2019s sinking\u2026 Where are all the bodies?<br></li><li>Lots of crabs.</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332060/extras/0ce753e2726bf93ccc725e9fe9247355.poster.avif?t=1752643848\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2332060/extras/0ce753e2726bf93ccc725e9fe9247355.apng?t=1752643848\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></span>",
